@baseUrl = http://localhost:5283

### Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Get task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Create task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build DayFlow Tasks API",
  "description": "Create the first CRUD module using ASP.NET Core",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-15T20:00:00Z",
  "priority": "High",
  "category": "Project"
}

### Update task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build DayFlow Tasks API - Updated",
  "description": "Update the first CRUD module",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-16T20:00:00Z",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "category": "Project"
}

### Complete task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/complete

### Delete task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
